{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99768","id":2204204727,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6DYX63","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99768","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99768.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99768.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99768","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99768/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99768/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99768/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/79f5a4d9fe966af0f0686e9d1cc36e819e8ace74","number":99768,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"OpenXR: Use the `XR_FB_foveation_vulkan` extension to get the density map for VRS","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This builds on top of PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99551 and is consequently marked as a DRAFT until it can be merged\r\n\r\nBut instead of manually building the density map, it uses the `XR_FB_foveation_vulkan` extension to get the density map from the OpenXR runtime.\r\n\r\nSo, you can use the same foveation settings that are currently used for OpenGL (setting the \"Foveation Level\" or \"Foveation Dynamic\"), and that should get used by the OpenXR runtime in order to build the density map that we're using.\r\n\r\nIn order to do that, it adds `XRInterface::get_vrs_texture_format()` which the interface can return any of these:\r\n\r\n- `XR_VRS_TEXTURE_FORMAT_UNIFIED`: This means `XRInterface::get_vrs_texture()` uses the same format as previously, and it doesn't matter whether or not the underlying mechanism is FDM or FSR, it runs through the shader and is converted to the right format. I'm open to renaming this!\r\n- `XR_VRS_TEXTURE_FORMAT_FRAGMENT_SHADING_RATE`: The VRS texture is in the format expected by fragment shading rate. I don't know that we'll ever use it this, but it's here for completeness\r\n- `XR_VRS_TEXTURE_FORMAT_FRAGMENT_DENSITY_MAP`: The VRS texture is in the format expected by fragment density map, which is what `XR_FB_foveation_vulkan` will give us\r\n\r\nIf `XR_FB_foveation_vulkan` isn't supported, then the `OpenXRInterface` will fallback on the original \"unified\" texture that is generated within Godot, so VRS will continue to work as it has for any OpenXR runtime that doesn't support this extension.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z"},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2024-11-27T20:15:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-17T14:17:25Z","closed_at":"2025-04-17T14:17:08Z","merged_at":"2025-04-17T14:17:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"98aced4e65418d3e5b1161cf8bd7c6f405f60907","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"no